flowchart TD
    Q[Universal mathematical claim] --> T{What evidence is offered?}
    T --> S[Simulation / numerical sampling]
    T --> P[Human-readable proof]
    T --> F[Machine-checked formal proof]
    S --> X[Supports or challenges conjectures; cannot prove all cases]
    P --> Y[Check hypotheses, deductions and scope]
    F --> Z[Check the formal statement, axioms, modeling and kernel]
    Y --> R[Independent scientific review]
    Z --> R
